{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫本年度《2026香港小姐競選》今日（2日）在電視城舉行首輪面試，有份獲邀參加首輪面試的參選佳麗於早上到電視城，準備下午見無綫高層進行面試。當中不乏打扮性感、身材出眾的高質靚女。</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、林迅景、陳釗</p><figure><img alt=\"黃薇。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413608099647488523647.jpeg/46T0hP9JQbNK8G0p9J69rDVFx7w7pl-Lau3Snmrt0p4\"/><figcaption>黃薇。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甄仲怡 Nabila。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413624751558656072864.jpeg/kZ9OslaxLcXKzw0frxXfHlnY0vAVfmP_8jfKuvI3yro\"/><figcaption>甄仲怡 Nabila。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413622692024320639408.jpeg/seCQLaDPT0jhq2iEx1B7zJQbGkoaPYCy3vHh2d7x4dk\"/><figure><img alt=\"吳芍希 23歲 香港人 在紐約讀書 剛剛畢業 現從事金融工作。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413620154339328631982.jpeg/h9x9TXBq6PQaBjKb4iKN6ZUHlRxGH2u_cr_ymXK_8pk\"/><figcaption>吳芍希 23歲 香港人 在紐約讀書 剛剛畢業 現從事金融工作。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳芍希貌似薛凱琪。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413617805398016810356.jpeg/RDj6QAP3QQolj5EaNVF5sZcKT1M0z5_IzQERe80BEXs\"/><figcaption>吳芍希貌似薛凱琪。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413615469039616975680.jpeg/VutxeQgUFoeQ78LKgC93HnaZIkdYgeBUfwHQKH8B0Cg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415285427113984045783.jpeg/4k7VgTQAmw1YeCKf0MYwh2XnFHpUXTnhOkEShzpBEoc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415282973315072091523.jpeg/mEO5xt2ntYKZhyOS2SogF2c6hBaMi6r8vkGj1L5Bo9Q\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415144955547648152094.jpeg/_IP6Zxdw6JLi-CUgGZlsE_o3DTL2zzQFad9WR2nfVkc\"/><figure><img alt=\"Cecilia。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415581318352896960174.jpeg/6UY0XvuVG3k5l4FSru3AaPx3waJkcKz-LCggOiwoIDo\"/><figcaption>Cecilia。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138416844634329088907132.jpeg/R-m4YTA9g4SD47RTcTFSWH_Xd0UVHcsi8Prxt_D68bc\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T01:58:42.041033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}